sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Feature: Brand & Currency Detection
    
    actor Blind User
    participant Cam as Camera
    participant AI as AI Classifier
    participant TTS as Feedback Service

    Blind User->>Cam: Points at Money/Product
    Cam->>AI: Send Frame
    
    alt Currency Mode
        AI->>AI: Run Currency Model (Identify Bill)
        AI-->>TTS: "50 Dollar Bill"
    else Brand Mode
        AI->>AI: Run Logo Detection
        AI-->>TTS: "Starbucks Coffee"
    end
    
    TTS->>Blind User: "50 Dollars"
